{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"case.c.array-traversal","version":"1.1.0","title":"数组遍历","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"kind":"demo","learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":["1.0.1"],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.arrays","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.loops","version":"1.0.0"}],"relatedLessonRefs":[{"id":"lesson.c.array-sum","version":"1.1.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0"},"teaching":{"objectives":["观察下标读取和累加"],"explanation":"从sum=0、i=0开始，循环读取values[i]并累加直到i==n。默认[3,-1,2]的累计值是3、2、4，输出4和换行。空输入不读占位数组，输出0。","exampleProgramRefs":[{"id":"program.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0"}],"commonMistakes":["空序列读占位值"],"boundaryNotes":["空、单项、多项"],"source":{"document":"content/c/p0/README.md","locator":"case.c.array-traversal；项目原创；沿用08.4已验证程序"}},"resultRule":"logical-array-sum","rewardRef":{"id":"reward.case.first-view","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0","title":"数组求和参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.int-sequence","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[3,-1,2]},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 3;\n    int values[3] = {3, -1, 2};\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1) {\n        sum = sum + values[i];\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"values","targetName":"n","targetKind":"logical-length","from":"length-of"},{"bindingKey":"param.values","inputKey":"values","targetName":"values","targetKind":"array","from":"field","emptyStorage":"one-zero-placeholder"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","ve